Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:22:59.07,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}大家都是什麼樣的動物呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.07,0:23:04.32,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}我想要知道 真實的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:09.45,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}大家聚在一起 軟綿綿的party
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:12.29,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}無論是小孩子還是大孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:16.63,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}ah 當你笑的時候 為我帶來了happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:19.96,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}耳朵和尾巴都在搖晃 ho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:21.71,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}毛茸 毛茸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.71,0:23:23.51,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}驚喜 驚喜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:25.26,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}撫摸 撫摸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:27.05,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}好癢 好癢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:28.68,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}毛茸 毛茸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.47,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}驚喜 驚喜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.47,0:23:33.64,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}撫摸 撫摸 你是最棒的！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Title,,0,0,0,,----------- TITLE -----------
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:16.68,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\b0\fn華康行楷體W5\fs80\fsp-5\shad0\pos(960,1030)}{\c&H947FFE&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord5\blur0\fscx80\fscy80}為了{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H8063EE&\bord5\blur0\fscx80\fscy80}在{\fscx150\fscy150}異世界{\c&H947FFE&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord5\blur0\fscx80\fscy80}也能{\c&H59FEFE&\3c&HF3C751&\bord10\blur5\fscx150\fscy150}撫摸{\c&H59FEFE&\3c&H358EE9&\bord10\blur5\fscx150\fscy150}毛茸茸{\c&H947FFE&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord5\blur0\fscx80\fscy80}而努力。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.29,0:02:38.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,440)\an1\fs60\bord4\shad0\b1\3c&H3F5490&\blur9\an7\pos(90,200)}第五話{\fsp-10} {\fsp0}森林的魔物令我驚艷！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an5\pos(975,340)\fs70\bord5\shad0\blur8\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H4042B4&\3a&44&}下一話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an5\pos(960,630)\fs80\bord5\shad0\blur8\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H4042B4&\3a&22&}想要變得更強的心情
